1
00:00:00,966 --> 00:00:04,666
(Stuart:)That's it, you just lost
bathroom privileges

2
00:00:04,670 --> 00:00:07,270
(Stuart:)at the comic book store.

3
00:00:12,244 --> 00:00:14,514
(muttering): Horse has
a basket on it. Stupid...

4
00:00:15,147 --> 00:00:17,347
(screams, grunts)

5
00:00:23,679 --> 00:00:25,749
(knocks)
SHELDON: Leonard.

6
00:00:25,748 --> 00:00:28,878
(knocks) Leonard. Leonard.

7
00:00:28,884 --> 00:00:30,684
(Leonard:)What?

8
00:00:30,686 --> 00:00:33,616
(Sheldon:)I never got to ask
my question about Batman.

9
00:00:36,391 --> 00:00:37,521
(Leonard:)What is it?

10
00:00:37,526 --> 00:00:41,066
(Sheldon:)If Batman were bitten
by a radioactive Man-Bat,

11
00:00:41,063 --> 00:00:44,763
(Sheldon:)and then fought crime
disguised as Man-Bat,

12
00:00:44,767 --> 00:00:47,897
(Sheldon:)would he be
Man-Bat-Man-Bat-Man

13
00:00:47,903 --> 00:00:51,573
(Sheldon:)or simply
Man-Bat-Man-Bat-Batman?

14
00:00:53,976 --> 00:00:58,246
(Penny:)Is he still wearing the Batman
suit under the Man-Bat suit?

15
00:01:00,548 --> 00:01:02,218
(Sheldon:)I'll be back.

